      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "FIDELITY: ledger:1026 and claims.yaml:17324-17330 match 'K : Fin m → X →L[ℂ] X', frames T, vacuum start and '∀ c, counts w c ≤ Nc c' (HermiteWordFock.lean:43-51). MAPPING: the TeX allows 'sum_j M_gij tensor K_ij' and assumes 'N_i ≥ r_i' at notes_stratonovich_ham_second_moment.tex:2532-2548. The row honestly states the one-mode restriction and omitted sums/integrals. All four abstract induction hypotheses are discharged; the coverage classification is a separate failure."
