      "reason": "The body correctly describes the one-mode coefficient model, insertion, frames, vacuum, four discharged hypotheses and omitted finite-sum/Bochner-integral statement (ledger:994-1026; HermiteWordFock.lean:43-51; main TeX:2531-2571). 'Nothing supplied' is true for that special case. Calling the section 'whole result' at ledger:992 nevertheless conflicts with its restricted scope (W2)."
