      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "All 19 declarations occur exactly once in the Index: ledger:818-823 contains 5 + 2 + 2 + 6 + 3 + 1 declarations under the correct labels, with the three route auxiliaries under 'no direct label'. Recursive manuscript label searches found one occurrence of each label cited by the target sections, all in notes_stratonovich_ham_second_moment.tex."
