      "claim": "COVERAGE-ROWS",
      "verdict": "FAIL",
      "reason": "W1: coverage.yaml:337 says 'same-assumptions', although HermiteWordFock.lean:43-48 accepts one K_i and one Gaussian mode per color, whereas main TeX:2532-2538 allows arbitrary m_i and K_ij. The scope correctly discloses this restriction, but 'weaker' does not make the assumption-class claim true. The other three rows honestly describe supplied inputs and narrower conclusions. All listed claim IDs were located in claims.yaml."
