      "claim": "SCOPE-RULES",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "The four sentences at coverage.yaml:339-341, 364-367, 486-489 and 1303-1306 match the corresponding ASCII entries at docs/coverage-scope-tex.yaml:17, 20, 26 and 59. Their TeX versions preserve the content. They contain no Lean declaration/module names or TeX source locations. None describes the variational rate lambda, so the square-root rule is not implicated."
