      "claim": "REFUTATIONS",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "CompressNonProjection.lean:21-32 refutes compression without idempotence using P = 2 id, giving 16 > 1. OccupiedConstant.lean:23-46 uses E[g^4] = 3 > 2 to refute n+1 in place of 4(n+1). TruncWithoutCutoff.lean:23-37 removes d ≤ N and exhibits a degree-one coefficient killed at cutoff zero. These are genuine perturbations of the relevant projection, multiplication and cutoff assertions; none relies on totalized arithmetic. Ledger:2393-2397 describes them accurately."
