      "claim": "CROSS-REFERENCES",
      "verdict": "PARTIAL",
      "reason": "The substantive references correctly distinguish the one-mode word theorem, supplied spatial columns, unformalized multi-mode applications and mild-construction remainder (ledger:263-266, 327-334, 3173-3176, 6743-6754, 8659-8678; main TeX:2625-2630, 3257-3262, 3490-3497). References at ledger:60, 755 and 2345 repeat the problematic 'whole result' section names and should follow the qualification repair in W2."
