      "claim": "CHANGED-PASSAGE HermiteWord",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "The changed prose and last-column entries (diffs/statement-ledger-changed-sections.diff:10-20; ledger:982-990) explicitly qualify discharge by 'one coordinate per color'. HermiteWord.lean:23-59 has exactly the reported support, frame and projection hypotheses; FockForm.lean:507-544 proves their concrete instances, and HermiteWordFock.lean:49-51 applies them. These are the induction steps in main TeX:2556-2565, restricted as disclosed."
